# An interceptor jet's missile has a tell (1.4): in GODMODE by a factory a jet comes at the
# gunship, flashes (nose and wingtips) with a lock-on beep, and only then fires. The rules
# (the whole tell, on every difficulty, the abort) are in tests/unit; this is the beep and the
# game printing both, on every profile. (No AA missile before the alert reaches 3, so the first
# "missile launched" is a jet's.)
wait-serial "AGK t0" 3000   # (the floppy loads run after the splash: seconds)
wait 10
press fire 2
wait-serial "theatre loaded=0"
# (the theatre card first: a fresh press of fire skips it)
wait 3
press fire 1
wait 24
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x0A
wait 30
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x09
wait-serial "jet tell" 4000
wait 6
screenshot flash
# the flare's white cores: the nose, and both wingtips (the jet flies north-east here: it is the shifted card start that changed the pose)
expect-color flash 152 179 0xFEC
expect-color flash 128 184 0xFEC
expect-color flash 147 203 0xFEC
expect-serial "sfx lockon"
wait 40
expect-serial "missile launched"
expect-no-serial "AGK ERR"
